What is it?
-----------
A very useful mail utility for sysops which..

  Allows you to kill mail (Urgent AND regular) for ANY user.
  Is a very efficient Mail Verify utility for SysOps.
  Is a mail scanner to let you know exactly WHO has mail on your system.

Installation:
-------------
Copy to Pfiles:Maintenance or any other directory.
Add the following line to BBSMENU under the MAINTENANCE commands:

               ME, MailEdit	|\#2pfiles:maintenance/MailEd\

Enter "ME" at any prompt to Verify/kill/scan mail.

